Package: tampaBayOpenData
Title: An R Interface to Tampa Bay Public Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jaclenga", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jack3lenga@gmail.com")
Description: Discover public ArcGIS layers in the City of Tampa and Tampa Bay
    Regional Planning Council organizations through live portal search. A
    bundled registry identifies City layers checked by package maintainers.
    Retrieve queryable layers with checked pagination, server-side filtering,
    typed tabular results, optional spatial objects, and source provenance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.2.3),
    jsonlite (>= 1.6.0),
    tibble (>= 3.0.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    sf (>= 1.0.0),
    testthat (>= 3.2.1)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
